---
source: tests/diagnostics_test.rs
expression: "format!(\"{shown}{summary}\\n\")"
---
error[era-shape]: the era line has no dates
   --> errors-era.md:12:1
   |
12 | **AI platforms · recent work**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: an era line is a whole bold paragraph: `**Era name · 2020 – 2023**`

error[era-shape]: the era line has too many ` · ` parts
   --> errors-era.md:14:1
   |
14 | **A · B · 2015 – 2016**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: an era line is a whole bold paragraph: `**Era name · 2020 – 2023**`

warning[mid-sentence-bold]: bold inside a sentence
   --> errors-era.md:16:1
   |
16 | **AI platforms · 2015 – 2016** with trailing words
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: bold only titles, companies, dates, and headings; for a lead-in write `**Label:** text`, with the colon inside

error[era-shape]: text follows the era line
   --> errors-era.md:16:1
   |
16 | **AI platforms · 2015 – 2016** with trailing words
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: an era line is only the bold text; move the rest into its own paragraph

error[era-shape]: era parts must be separated by ` · `, not `-`
   --> errors-era.md:18:1
   |
18 | **AI platforms - 2016 – 2017**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ fixable
   |
   = help: did you mean `**AI platforms · 2016 – 2017**`?

error[era-shape]: era parts must be separated by ` · `, not `-`
   --> errors-era.md:20:1
   |
20 | **Gusto - Webtab - 2012 – 2013**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: an era is `**Era name · 2020 – 2023**`; the name can't contain separators

error[era-shape]: era lines must be plain text
   --> errors-era.md:22:1
   |
22 | **Platform *x* · 2016**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write it without italics, links, or code: `**Era name · 2020 – 2023**`

error[era-shape]: era parts must be separated by ` · `
   --> errors-era.md:24:1
   |
24 | **Class of 2010 | 2016 – 2017**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write `**Era name · 2020 – 2023**`; the name contains a year, so no automatic fix is offered

error[era-shape]: era parts must be separated by ` · `, not `-`
   --> errors-era.md:26:1
   |
26 | **Award - 2019**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: if this is an era, write `**Award · 2019**`; a hyphen can also be ordinary bold text, so no automatic fix is offered

error[era-shape]: the era name is empty
   --> errors-era.md:28:1
   |
28 | **| 2020 – 2021**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write `**Era name · 2020 – 2023**`

error[era-outside-role]: an era line must be inside a role
   --> errors-era.md:32:1
   |
32 | **Outside · 2015 – 2016**
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: put it under a `### Company · Title · Period` role line

